WEBVTT

asr-000001
02:03:52.000 --> 02:03:53.000
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed.

asr-000002
02:03:55.400 --> 02:03:56.540
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000003
02:03:57.500 --> 02:04:01.520
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, under the calendar of unfinished business,

asr-000004
02:04:02.180 --> 02:04:07.180
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: I move to resume consideration of House Bill No. 10858

asr-000005
02:04:07.180 --> 02:04:11.440
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: as contained in Committee Report No. 638

asr-000006
02:04:11.440 --> 02:04:17.680
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: and for this purpose, direct the Secretary General to read the title of the said measure.

asr-000007
02:04:18.760 --> 02:04:19.340
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: An objection?

asr-000008
02:04:19.340 --> 02:04:26.480
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Hearing none, the Secretary General is hereby directed to read the title of House Bill No. 10858.

asr-000009
02:04:28.100 --> 02:04:34.400
Secretary-General: House Bill 10858, an act appropriating funds for the operation of the Government of the Republic of the Philippines

asr-000010
02:04:34.400 --> 02:04:38.820
Secretary-General: from January 1 to December 31, 2027.

asr-000011
02:04:40.040 --> 02:04:40.900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000012
02:04:42.260 --> 02:04:47.360
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, the parliamentary status of House Bill No. 10858

asr-000013
02:04:47.360 --> 02:04:49.320
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: is that the period of its implementation

asr-000014
02:04:49.340 --> 02:04:51.700
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: by sponsorship and debate has been closed.

asr-000015
02:04:52.400 --> 02:04:55.280
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: I now move to open the period of amendments.

asr-000016
02:04:56.500 --> 02:04:57.860
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Is there an objection?

asr-000017
02:04:59.500 --> 02:05:01.440
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Hearing none, the motion is approved.

asr-000018
02:05:01.560 --> 02:05:03.700
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The period of amendments is now open.

asr-000019
02:05:04.600 --> 02:05:05.560
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000020
02:05:06.360 --> 02:05:09.560
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the sponsor,

asr-000021
02:05:10.260 --> 02:05:12.920
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Representative Micaela Angela B. Sonsing,

asr-000022
02:05:13.360 --> 02:05:16.520
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: to consider amendments to the bill, if any.

asr-000023
02:05:16.760 --> 02:05:19.320
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Sonsing, Chairperson of the Committee,

asr-000024
02:05:19.400 --> 02:05:21.820
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Committee of Appropriations, is hereby recognized.

asr-000025
02:05:22.700 --> 02:05:24.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Madam Speaker.

asr-000026
02:05:24.620 --> 02:05:29.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I am now ready to go forward with the consideration of individual amendments.

asr-000027
02:05:30.740 --> 02:05:32.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, same as last time,

asr-000028
02:05:32.400 --> 02:05:35.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would like to request for the indulgence of the body for me to sit down.

asr-000029
02:05:36.120 --> 02:05:41.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I am now 38 weeks pregnant, but still working for the budget.

asr-000030
02:05:41.080 --> 02:05:44.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, I would like to request the kind indulgence of our distinguished colleagues.

asr-000031
02:05:45.780 --> 02:05:46.600
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000032
02:05:47.120 --> 02:05:47.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Point of order.

asr-000033
02:05:48.120 --> 02:05:49.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Point of order, Madam Speaker.

asr-000034
02:05:49.400 --> 02:05:53.160
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: And may we know the point of order of the Honorable Tino.

asr-000035
02:05:53.940 --> 02:05:59.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker, I cite Rule 9, Committees,

asr-000036
02:06:00.800 --> 02:06:07.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particularly Section 28D on Appropriations,

asr-000037
02:06:07.400 --> 02:06:08.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which states,

asr-000038
02:06:09.740 --> 02:06:14.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The BARC, which is the Budget Amendments and Review Subcommittee,

asr-000039
02:06:14.960 --> 02:06:18.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the BARC shall be tasked to produce a detailed report,

asr-000040
02:06:19.340 --> 02:06:23.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that includes any and all realignments and modifications

asr-000041
02:06:23.800 --> 02:06:28.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: from any agency, including increases and decreases,

asr-000042
02:06:28.900 --> 02:06:33.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: with sufficient details, including the proponent legislator.

asr-000043
02:06:33.540 --> 02:06:39.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The BARC shall similarly publish reports in the House website

asr-000044
02:06:39.380 --> 02:06:42.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on budgetary allocations per government agency

asr-000045
02:06:42.720 --> 02:06:45.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in each legislative district,

asr-000046
02:06:46.760 --> 02:06:48.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which shall subsequently be distributed,

asr-000047
02:06:49.340 --> 02:06:52.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to all members of the House.

asr-000048
02:06:53.180 --> 02:06:53.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, Madam Speaker,

asr-000049
02:06:55.060 --> 02:06:58.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: we are already in the period of amendments,

asr-000050
02:06:59.280 --> 02:07:02.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and yet, there is still no, as far as I know,

asr-000051
02:07:03.940 --> 02:07:07.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there is no compliance with the requirements of the rule

asr-000052
02:07:07.600 --> 02:07:10.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that the BARC must produce a detailed report

asr-000053
02:07:10.800 --> 02:07:13.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of proposed amendments,

asr-000054
02:07:14.360 --> 02:07:18.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it being subcommittee on budget amendments,

asr-000055
02:07:19.340 --> 02:07:24.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and that such detailed report be furnished to all members,

asr-000056
02:07:25.780 --> 02:07:34.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and that it be published on the website of the House.

asr-000057
02:07:35.400 --> 02:07:36.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, Madam Speaker,

asr-000058
02:07:38.660 --> 02:07:44.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: narinig po natin, kahit po dun sa live stream mismo ng BARC,

asr-000059
02:07:44.080 --> 02:07:49.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sinabi po ng Chair, our esteemed Chair of the Committee on Appropriations,

asr-000060
02:07:49.340 --> 02:07:51.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na hindi na raw po magpuproduce ng separate

asr-000061
02:07:51.800 --> 02:07:55.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o maglalabas ng separate report ang BARC.

asr-000062
02:07:57.100 --> 02:08:02.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yung amended text na lamang ng GAB ang ipipresent dito.

asr-000063
02:08:03.680 --> 02:08:06.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa totoo lang, kahit po sa media,

asr-000064
02:08:06.700 --> 02:08:10.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay walang summary man lang na pinroduce.

asr-000065
02:08:11.040 --> 02:08:14.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kinailangan pa po na kami, individual,

asr-000066
02:08:14.360 --> 02:08:15.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: through individual effort,

asr-000067
02:08:15.620 --> 02:08:18.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang maghanap kung ano ba talaga yung mga amendments,

asr-000068
02:08:19.340 --> 02:08:24.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and we found that a total of 116.32 billion

asr-000069
02:08:24.520 --> 02:08:30.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in increases were proposed by the BARC.

asr-000070
02:08:31.160 --> 02:08:35.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinakamalaki dito ay increase sa ma-ifip ng DOH,

asr-000071
02:08:36.360 --> 02:08:38.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: amounting to 28 billion,

asr-000072
02:08:38.840 --> 02:08:41.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: DSW, DIX, 26 billion,

asr-000073
02:08:42.380 --> 02:08:46.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: merong dole tupad na 5.11 billion,

asr-000074
02:08:46.140 --> 02:08:48.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung controversial na LGSF,

asr-000075
02:08:48.440 --> 02:08:53.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinagdagan ng 4.09 billion yung DPWH,

asr-000076
02:08:54.240 --> 02:08:57.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinagdagan ng 11.49 billion.

asr-000077
02:08:59.720 --> 02:09:04.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngunit, hindi naman sinabi, on the other hand,

asr-000078
02:09:05.680 --> 02:09:09.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: saan binawas o saan nanggaling yung mga dagdag na ito.

asr-000079
02:09:10.160 --> 02:09:15.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pangalawa, sa mga increases po,

asr-000080
02:09:15.740 --> 02:09:16.900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: just to align.

asr-000081
02:09:17.320 --> 02:09:18.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo.

asr-000082
02:09:18.440 --> 02:09:20.720
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Your point of order is based on

asr-000083
02:09:20.720 --> 02:09:21.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

asr-000084
02:09:21.760 --> 02:09:22.920
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Section 27,

asr-000085
02:09:23.700 --> 02:09:24.820
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Section 28,

asr-000086
02:09:25.760 --> 02:09:27.380
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: D on the Appropriations Committee.

asr-000087
02:09:27.660 --> 02:09:29.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, that is correct, Madam Speaker.

asr-000088
02:09:29.040 --> 02:09:31.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And, yung isa pang punto po,

asr-000089
02:09:31.380 --> 02:09:34.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga increases na pinropose po sa BARC,

asr-000090
02:09:35.280 --> 02:09:37.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay mga lump sum increases lang po,

asr-000091
02:09:37.360 --> 02:09:40.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi din italye kung saan mapupunta.

asr-000092
02:09:40.740 --> 02:09:49.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For example, in the case of the DPWH increase of 11.49 billion.

asr-000115
02:09:49.140 --> 02:09:54.840
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of the Honorable Tinio, for proper response, may we...

asr-000115-split-2
02:09:54.840 --> 02:09:57.880
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session is suspended for a few minutes.

asr-000206
02:37:35.280 --> 02:37:42.390
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed. Majority Leader.

asr-000206-split-2
02:37:42.390 --> 02:37:51.980
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, in response to the point of order of the good gentleman from ACT Teachers Party List,

asr-000207
02:37:52.000 --> 02:37:54.620
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Allow me to state the following.

asr-000208
02:37:56.020 --> 02:38:01.740
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: The BARC proceedings were live-streamed in the official online platform of the House,

asr-000209
02:38:02.680 --> 02:38:13.640
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: and that the amendments as approved by the BARC were incorporated to the substitute text of House Bill No. 10858

asr-000210
02:38:13.640 --> 02:38:21.680
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: under Committee Report 638 as submitted to the plenary to be considered during the period

asr-000211
02:38:21.680 --> 02:38:22.440
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: of amendments.

asr-000212
02:38:23.560 --> 02:38:30.380
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: This substitute bill was furnished to all the members via their registered email addresses

asr-000213
02:38:30.380 --> 02:38:34.180
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: and was also posted in the House website.

asr-000214
02:38:34.900 --> 02:38:40.660
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: As such, the majority submits that the point of order is not well taken.

asr-000215
02:38:43.660 --> 02:38:44.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker,

asr-000216
02:38:46.000 --> 02:38:46.920
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: His Honorable Tino,

asr-000225
02:38:50.940 --> 02:38:59.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Does the Speaker have a position on the manifestation of the majority, Madam Speaker?

asr-000226
02:39:00.700 --> 02:39:03.000
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Well, that was the position of the majority.

asr-000227
02:39:04.260 --> 02:39:08.340
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Your point of order is not well taken based on the reasons aforementioned.

asr-000228
02:39:08.340 --> 02:39:17.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, Madam Speaker, I note that position, it is not well taken.

asr-000229
02:39:17.540 --> 02:39:21.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However, I assert that the rules are very clear.

asr-000230
02:39:21.720 --> 02:39:27.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napakalinaw po sa rules na kailangan may report ang BARC, hiwalay na report ito.

asr-000231
02:39:27.720 --> 02:39:37.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pwedeng sabihin yung revised version ng House General Appropriations Bill, ay yun ang report na yun.

asr-000232
02:39:37.940 --> 02:39:48.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sinasabi dito, dapat specified ang bawat amendment, kung ano yung dinagdag at ano yung dinagdagan, ano yung binawasan para mabuo ang amendment.

asr-000233
02:39:48.580 --> 02:39:51.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi rin dito, bawat isang proponent dapat nakapag-report.

asr-000234
02:39:51.720 --> 02:39:58.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And finally, dapat i-publish at dapat bawat membro ay may kopya.

asr-000235
02:39:58.780 --> 02:40:03.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nananadili po tayo sa posisyon na yun ang nakasaad at yun ang dapat sundin.

asr-000236
02:40:04.400 --> 02:40:12.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At kung walang tinatago ang Kongreso, ay dapat ipakita sa lahat kung ano yung mga amendments.

asr-000237
02:40:12.940 --> 02:40:15.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hanggang dun po, Madam Speaker.

asr-000238
02:40:15.080 --> 02:40:16.280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Hon. Tino.

asr-000239
02:40:17.140 --> 02:40:21.280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Eli of Party-list Kamanggagawa is hereby recognized.

asr-000240
02:40:21.720 --> 02:40:23.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-000241
02:40:25.900 --> 02:40:28.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ilang obserbasyon lang po hinggil po sa proseso.

asr-000242
02:40:30.340 --> 02:40:36.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nabanggit na po ng kagalang-galang na kinatawa ng Act Teacher's Partylist na malino po sa ating rules,

asr-000243
02:40:36.760 --> 02:40:45.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Rule 9, Section 28D, na kinakailangan po ng BARC na mag-provide ng detalyadong report

asr-000244
02:40:45.020 --> 02:40:51.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: in any and all realignments and modifications from any agency including increases,

asr-000245
02:40:51.720 --> 02:40:58.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and decreases with sufficient details, including the proponent legislator,

asr-000246
02:40:58.620 --> 02:41:05.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and that the BARC shall similarly publish reports in the House website on budgetary allocations

asr-000247
02:41:05.040 --> 02:41:13.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: per government agency in each legislative district, which shall subsequently be distributed to all members of the House.

asr-000248
02:41:13.880 --> 02:41:20.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This representation takes note of the answer of the majority, Madam Speaker, na ni-livestream naman daw po,

asr-000249
02:41:20.500 --> 02:41:24.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pero ang paninindigan po ng Minorya, ang livestream po ay hindi report.

asr-000250
02:41:25.220 --> 02:41:26.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hiwalay po ang BARC report.

asr-000251
02:41:27.480 --> 02:41:35.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Last point, Madam Speaker, binabanggit po na naipadala ang substitute bill sa mga miyembro ng bulwagang ito.

asr-000252
02:41:35.680 --> 02:41:37.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This representation would like to put on record.

asr-000253
02:41:38.420 --> 02:41:45.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 1.57 a.m., pinadala ang substitute bill, ang substitute text ng House Bill No. 10858.

asr-000254
02:41:46.400 --> 02:41:49.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Almost 4,000 pages po ang kailangang aralin.

asr-000255
02:41:50.500 --> 02:41:59.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng mga mambabatas upang matiyak po na tunay na sinasalamin nito kung ano ang mga lumabas na usapan dito sa bulwagang ito.

asr-000256
02:42:00.080 --> 02:42:06.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So gusto po namin ibigyang linaw at idiin, Madam Speaker, na hindi po sapat ang oras na ibinigay.

asr-000257
02:42:07.120 --> 02:42:11.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 1.57 a.m., alas dos ng madaling araw po, Madam Speaker.

asr-000258
02:42:12.020 --> 02:42:18.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So yun lang po ang obserbasyon ng kinatawang ito at ng aming pagdiin na dapat po ay ilabas ang BARC report.

asr-000259
02:42:18.800 --> 02:42:20.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker.

asr-000260
02:42:20.500 --> 02:42:25.060
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The manifestation of the Hon. Eli San Fernando is noted, Majority Leader.

asr-000261
02:42:25.500 --> 02:42:26.040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker.

asr-000262
02:42:27.540 --> 02:42:30.640
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Hon. Toby Tiangco is recognized.

asr-000263
02:42:31.780 --> 02:42:34.920
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker, I would like to make a manifestation regarding these two.

asr-000264
02:42:35.420 --> 02:42:45.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Noon pa lang, September 24, during the interpellation of the budget of the DPWH, I already read this exact text, no?

asr-000265
02:42:45.980 --> 02:42:50.380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yung kung ano po yung binasa ni Congressman Tino.

asr-000266
02:42:50.500 --> 02:42:52.820
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ay binasa ko rin noong araw na yun, no?

asr-000267
02:42:53.040 --> 02:42:55.420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Na talagang nakasaad po yun sa rules natin, no?

asr-000268
02:42:56.040 --> 02:43:02.360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So I just hope that since that was before the BARC, sana naman po ay sinunod natin yung rules natin.

asr-000269
02:43:02.860 --> 02:43:08.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi po ang pinakamahalaga dito is meron tayong mga ahensyang dinagdagan ng pondo, no?

asr-000270
02:43:09.100 --> 02:43:17.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero dahil ang ating budget ay zero sum, dapat din natin sanang malaman kung saan nang galing yung pondong idinagdag.

asr-000271
02:43:17.960 --> 02:43:19.780
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi kung wala pong binawasan,

asr-000272
02:43:20.500 --> 02:43:21.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: eh wala pong madadagdagan.

asr-000273
02:43:22.640 --> 02:43:28.420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: But as it is, yun nga po, kahit ako kanina sinubukan kong i-chat GPT,

asr-000274
02:43:28.920 --> 02:43:35.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi ko naman po pwedeng assume na 100% tama yung binigay ng chat GPT, di ba?

asr-000275
02:43:35.660 --> 02:43:38.340
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ngayon, yung staff ko hanggang ngayon, hindi pa rin tapos, no?

asr-000276
02:43:39.040 --> 02:43:44.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, sana po, ginawa natin ito dahil ito po ay napakahalaga, no?

asr-000277
02:43:45.120 --> 02:43:46.160
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yun lang po, Madam Speaker.

asr-000278
02:43:46.380 --> 02:43:48.580
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Honorable Toby Tiangco.

asr-000279
02:43:48.660 --> 02:43:50.160
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The manifestation is well noted.

asr-000280
02:43:50.500 --> 02:43:51.640
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000281
02:43:52.240 --> 02:43:54.680
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker, may I be recognized?

asr-000282
02:43:54.680 --> 02:43:56.720
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Egay Erice is recognized.

asr-000283
02:43:56.720 --> 02:43:59.860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, I don't want to belabor the points of our colleagues.

asr-000284
02:44:00.240 --> 02:44:13.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang hinihiling ko na lang po, sana po before Monday, kung pwede mabigyan kami ng exact copy ng pagbabago sa ating GAB, especially on the special provision.

asr-000285
02:44:13.400 --> 02:44:13.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you.

asr-000286
02:44:15.880 --> 02:44:18.380
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The manifestation of the Honorable Erice is noted.

asr-000287
02:44:19.380 --> 02:44:20.200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000288
02:44:20.500 --> 02:44:21.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker.

asr-000289
02:44:21.640 --> 02:44:25.000
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, we are still in the period of amendment.

asr-000290
02:44:25.140 --> 02:44:25.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker.

asr-000291
02:44:27.120 --> 02:44:29.520
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May we know the pleasure of the Honorable Rene Co.

asr-000292
02:44:30.000 --> 02:44:31.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Another manifestation, Madam Speaker.

asr-000293
02:44:32.240 --> 02:44:34.180
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Rene Co has three minutes.

asr-000294
02:44:35.240 --> 02:44:46.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, I join the members of the minority in the pointing out that there is a rule that ought to be followed in the transparency,

asr-000295
02:44:47.400 --> 02:44:50.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: not only to the fellow members of the House, but to the people.

asr-000296
02:44:50.500 --> 02:44:54.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: On the movements in the House of Representatives for the budget.

asr-000297
02:44:54.120 --> 02:45:11.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, sana nga po, sa pinakakagyat ay maipakita yung, hindi lang yung pagdagdag, pero kung saan po nabawasan yung gustong makita na amendments to the budget.

asr-000298
02:45:11.420 --> 02:45:17.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The people deserve the information, not only is it as a right, but it is also our responsibility.

asr-000299
02:45:17.740 --> 02:45:18.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-000302
02:45:19.680 --> 02:45:23.430
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The manifestation of the Honorable Rene Co is noted.

asr-000303
02:45:23.500 --> 02:45:27.100
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Sarah Jane Elago is recognized for a brief manifestation.

asr-000304
02:45:28.080 --> 02:45:29.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-000305
02:45:29.840 --> 02:45:35.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais lang din pong magbigay ng suporta ng kinatawan ng kababaihan mula sa Gabriela Women's Party

asr-000306
02:45:35.840 --> 02:45:41.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng panawagan ng ating mga kasamahan para sa buong ulat, buong report na may detalye,

asr-000307
02:45:42.140 --> 02:45:45.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung saan ba nadagdagan ng mga programa, saan ba nabawasan.

asr-000308
02:45:45.120 --> 02:45:49.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayun din, kung meron bang mga pagbabago pagdating sa mga special provisions,

asr-000309
02:45:50.500 --> 02:45:53.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: the principles na nakasaad sa ating General Appropriations Bill.

asr-000310
02:45:53.960 --> 02:46:01.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, lalong-lalo na ngayon sa panahon na lubos na nananawagan ng ating mga kababayan para sa buong transparency.

asr-000311
02:46:01.720 --> 02:46:10.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At mahirap po matiyak ang buong-buo na transparency at accountability kung wala ho tayong mapag-aaralan at mabubusisi na detalyadong report.

asr-000312
02:46:11.140 --> 02:46:12.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-000313
02:46:12.140 --> 02:46:14.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The manifestation of the Honorable Elago is duly noted.

asr-000314
02:46:14.960 --> 02:46:19.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Parliamentary Status of House Bill No. 10858.

asr-000315
02:46:20.500 --> 02:46:23.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: is that we are now in the period of amendments.

asr-000316
02:46:24.500 --> 02:46:28.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Suansing has been recognized as sponsor of such.

asr-000317
02:46:29.500 --> 02:46:30.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000318
02:46:31.500 --> 02:46:38.500
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, there being no committee amendments and pursuant to Section 106 of our rules,

asr-000319
02:46:38.500 --> 02:46:42.500
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: I move to proceed with the amendments by substitution.

asr-000320
02:46:47.500 --> 02:46:49.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Is there an objection?

asr-000321
02:46:50.500 --> 02:46:52.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Hearing none, the motion is approved.

asr-000322
02:46:58.500 --> 02:47:00.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The entire bill is...

asr-000323
02:47:01.500 --> 02:47:02.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000324
02:47:03.500 --> 02:47:12.500
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, earlier we have distributed to the members copies of the Substitute Bill to the House Bill No. 10858.

asr-000325
02:47:13.500 --> 02:47:19.500
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: Madam Speaker, I move to amend by substitution the entire bill as contained in Committee Report No. 638.

asr-000326
02:47:20.500 --> 02:47:28.500
Rep. Manuel "Wowo" L. Fortes Jr.: With the contents of the substitute bill earlier distributed to all the members, I so move, Madam Speaker.

asr-000327
02:47:28.500 --> 02:47:33.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Is there an objection? Hearing none, the motion is approved.

asr-000328
02:47:33.500 --> 02:47:35.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I object, Madam Speaker.

asr-000329
02:47:37.500 --> 02:47:38.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is an objection.

asr-000330
02:47:38.500 --> 02:47:43.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is an objection to the motion to amend by substitution the entire bill.

asr-000331
02:47:43.500 --> 02:47:52.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Speaker, I object and I invoke the five-minute rule to explain my objection.

asr-000332
02:47:53.500 --> 02:47:55.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Prior to the explanation of your vote, may we request...

asr-000333
02:47:55.500 --> 02:47:57.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Not my vote, my objection, Madam Speaker.

asr-000334
02:47:58.500 --> 02:48:00.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Okay, you have five minutes, Honorable Tino. Please proceed.

asr-000335
02:48:01.500 --> 02:48:02.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-000336
02:48:02.500 --> 02:48:05.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, I object to the amendment by substitution.

asr-000337
02:48:06.500 --> 02:48:11.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: First of all, because of the point we raised earlier,

asr-000338
02:48:11.500 --> 02:48:22.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it is not transparent to give the report of BARC that details what are the amendments that were made.

asr-000339
02:48:23.500 --> 02:48:30.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And our colleagues said earlier that it is not enough to say that it is in the live stream.

asr-000340
02:48:31.500 --> 02:48:35.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Having said that, we also looked at the amendments in the live stream.

asr-000341
02:48:35.500 --> 02:48:50.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We looked at them one by one and it shows that a total of P116 billion was saved here, P116.32 billion.

asr-000342
02:48:52.000 --> 02:49:02.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ang pinakamalaking mga amendments ay para sa dagdag sa MAIFIP, that's over 28 billion.

asr-000343
02:49:02.320 --> 02:49:05.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa DSWD, 26 billion, yan yung AICS.

asr-000344
02:49:06.200 --> 02:49:12.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa Department of, sa DOLE, 5.11 billion para sa Tupad.

asr-000345
02:49:12.440 --> 02:49:17.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa LGSF, binagdagan pa ng 4.09 billion.

asr-000346
02:49:19.040 --> 02:49:24.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa TESDA, 1.44 billion pangunahin sa mga scholarships.

asr-000347
02:49:25.400 --> 02:49:34.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ito yung mga ayuda programs ng iba't ibang mga ahensyang ito,

asr-000348
02:49:34.480 --> 02:49:41.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which among others requires or involves the discretion of legislators

asr-000349
02:49:41.580 --> 02:49:42.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in

asr-000350
02:49:42.440 --> 02:49:44.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: allocating this ayuda.

asr-000351
02:49:45.360 --> 02:49:47.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kaya may pagtutulpo tayo ron.

asr-000352
02:49:47.940 --> 02:49:52.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, may mga inamend din po, for example, sa DPWH budget,

asr-000353
02:49:53.220 --> 02:49:56.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinagdagan ng 11.49 billion pesos.

asr-000354
02:49:56.620 --> 02:50:00.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So nadagdagan yung total, pero actually internally,

asr-000355
02:50:01.580 --> 02:50:08.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: internally ay 98.8 billion pesos po ang total na binago.

asr-000356
02:50:09.340 --> 02:50:12.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including 6,262

asr-000357
02:50:12.440 --> 02:50:18.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: individual projects na wala sa NEP,

asr-000358
02:50:19.340 --> 02:50:27.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero nandito na sa amended House version na pinapapasa sa atin.

asr-000359
02:50:27.980 --> 02:50:34.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unfortunately, dahil nga hindi na-present at nabigyan tayo ng report,

asr-000360
02:50:34.720 --> 02:50:42.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi alam ng publiko at ng nakararaming mga miyembro ang mga amendments na ito.

asr-000361
02:50:42.440 --> 02:50:47.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, for all of these reasons, Madam Chair,

asr-000362
02:50:47.220 --> 02:50:52.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: samantala, inod din natin na yung ilang mga demands na nire-raise,

asr-000363
02:50:52.980 --> 02:50:58.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: katulad nung substantial increase in personnel economic relief allowance,

asr-000364
02:50:59.380 --> 02:51:05.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung pagtiyak na mapopondohan ang free higher education deficiency

asr-000365
02:51:05.800 --> 02:51:10.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mga state universities and colleges for 2026 and 2027,

asr-000366
02:51:12.440 --> 02:51:19.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung production subsidy para sa mga magsasaka at mangingisda,

asr-000367
02:51:19.940 --> 02:51:27.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung pagdagdag sa budget ng edukasyon sa mga public hospitals at iba pa,

asr-000368
02:51:27.980 --> 02:51:35.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: lalo pa ngayon na napakatindi ng inflation, 7.2% po ang latest inflation figures.

asr-000369
02:51:37.140 --> 02:51:41.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa tingin po natin, ay hindi matutugunan ng amendments,

asr-000370
02:51:42.440 --> 02:51:49.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: via substitution, ang mga pangangailangan ito ng sambayan ng Pilipino,

asr-000371
02:51:50.100 --> 02:51:56.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nananatiling pangunahin sa P116B, almost P100B,

asr-000372
02:51:57.400 --> 02:52:07.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay matatawag na pork type amendments, both para sa ayuda at para sa infrastructure,

asr-000373
02:52:08.220 --> 02:52:11.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kaya tinututulan po natin ito, Madam Speaker.

asr-000374
02:52:12.440 --> 02:52:17.260
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Parliamentary Status is as follows.

asr-000375
02:52:18.180 --> 02:52:23.100
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: A motion was put forward by the Majority Leader earlier to amend by substitution

asr-000376
02:52:23.100 --> 02:52:29.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: House Bill No. 10858, duly objected by the Honorable Tinio.

asr-000377
02:52:31.260 --> 02:52:34.680
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With this, we have to go on a vote.

asr-000378
02:52:35.440 --> 02:52:39.520
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: An aye vote means you sustain the motion of the Majority Leader

asr-000379
02:52:39.520 --> 02:52:44.160
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: to amend by substitution House Bill No. 10858.

asr-000380
02:52:44.940 --> 02:52:49.200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: A nay vote means you sustain the objection of the Honorable Tinio.

asr-000381
02:52:52.200 --> 02:52:55.460
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Those in favor of the motion of the Majority Leader, say aye.

asr-000382
02:52:55.980 --> 02:52:56.540
Committee Members Voting Aye: Aye.

asr-000383
02:52:57.160 --> 02:52:59.000
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Those who are not in favor, say nay.

asr-000384
02:52:59.340 --> 02:52:59.900
Committee Members Voting Nay: Nay.

asr-000385
02:53:00.480 --> 02:53:06.320
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The ayes have it. House Bill No. 10858 is amended by substitution of the entire bill.

