asr-000576
03:10:02.900 --> 03:10:11.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero for now, dahil binubuno at nilalaban pa po yung source of funding,

asr-000577
03:10:12.180 --> 03:10:19.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: we propose the wording of, the insertion of the phrase, at least.

asr-000578
03:10:19.520 --> 03:10:24.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, now the provision will read,

asr-000579
03:10:25.340 --> 03:10:31.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: personal economic relief allowance in the amount of at least 2,000 pesos per month.

asr-000580
03:10:32.700 --> 03:10:36.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun po yung proposal natin sa ngayon,

asr-000581
03:10:37.580 --> 03:10:47.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: with the understanding na this is meant to give the DBM and Malacanang flexibility

asr-000582
03:10:47.640 --> 03:10:48.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in

asr-000586
03:10:48.500 --> 03:10:58.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: raising the amount beyond what is currently stated as 2,000 pesos per month.

