asr-000677
03:21:19.520 --> 03:21:24.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: special provision catering to the demand of state universities and colleges

asr-000678
03:21:24.580 --> 03:21:29.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of the still existing free higher education deficiencies

asr-000679
03:21:29.140 --> 03:21:37.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: found in academic years 2024 to 2025, 2025 and 2026.

asr-000680
03:21:37.020 --> 03:21:49.200
