asr-000699
03:23:41.700 --> 03:23:46.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: particularly, as mentioned in the BARC proceedings,

asr-000700
03:23:47.400 --> 03:23:49.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to fund the clinical legal education.

asr-000701
03:23:49.520 --> 03:24:15.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, Madam Speaker, may I request, just for the clarity of the proceedings,

asr-000702
03:24:15.720 --> 03:24:19.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may we request for these two amendments to be put into motion?

asr-000703
03:24:19.520 --> 03:24:28.780
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May we request the Honorable Court to individually propose the amendment?

asr-000704
03:24:30.040 --> 03:24:32.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Will do, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-000705
03:24:32.540 --> 03:24:38.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: In that sense, I retract my third amendment for now,

asr-000706
03:24:38.820 --> 03:24:46.920
