asr-000707
03:24:46.920 --> 03:24:49.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: found in line 24.

asr-000708
03:24:49.520 --> 03:24:54.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Page 349, to replace the word may, to shall,

asr-000709
03:24:55.240 --> 03:25:02.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: so that it can read that the HEDF shall also be used to cover the current year's FHE deficiencies.

asr-000710
03:25:02.700 --> 03:25:03.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-000711
