asr-000722
03:26:01.420 --> 03:26:05.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we're a little bit cautious to put shall,

asr-000723
03:26:06.060 --> 03:26:13.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because the amount may exceed the 2.995 billion pesos that we've provided for in the special provision.

asr-000724
03:26:13.940 --> 03:26:16.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And for that reason, Madam Speaker,

asr-000725
03:26:17.400 --> 03:26:19.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as much as I would like to,

asr-000726
03:26:19.280 --> 03:26:22.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: accept the proposed amendment,

asr-000727
03:26:22.000 --> 03:26:24.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the committee respectfully rejects the proposed amendment.

asr-000728
03:26:25.820 --> 03:26:27.880
